                    <p>I'm a Computer Networking and Cybersecurity enthusiast currently serving as <strong>Treasurer of NSUCEC</strong> (NSU Computer & Engineering Club). With hands-on experience in IT support, network configuration, and security operations, I bring both technical expertise and leadership skills to every project.</p>
                    <p>Currently pursuing <strong>B.Sc. in Computer Science & Engineering</strong> at North South University, I specialize in network architecture, threat analysis, and secure system administration. My experience includes working with MikroTik routers, implementing security protocols, and managing enterprise-level network infrastructure.</p>
