                        <h3>IT / Network Support</h3>
                        <h4>DV NET, DHAKA</h4>
                        <p class="experience-description">Worked at DV NET, a local reseller internet provider in Dhaka, managing MikroTik routers via WinBox, troubleshooting network issues, monitoring logs for potential attacks, and ensuring stable and secure internet service for clients.</p>
                        <ul class="experience-highlights">
                            <li>Used my troubleshooting method to manage MikroTik routers via WinBox with ensure stable network performance for all clients up to 50%</li>
                            <li>Used my monitoring technique to keep network uptime consistent and reduce interruptions that helps company ton revenue 2%</li>
                            <li>Used my log-analysis method to identify unusual activity and detect potential security issues that increases clients trust upto 9%</li>
